Add weekly subscription support

- Weekly subscriptions charge every 7 days from their first charge (--since)
- Monthly cost is calculated as price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded down to nearest cent
- Weekly plans appear in renewals list like any other subscription
- Fix renewals sorting to sort by date instead of short label string

